&lt;h1 id="22-借用检查"&gt;2.2 借用检查&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rust 的_借用检查器_（borrow checker）对借用值的方式施加约束。我们已经见过：引用不能_比_它所借用的值_活得更久_：&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2.3 借用错误</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/day3-afternoon/borrowing/03-examples/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/day3-afternoon/borrowing/03-examples/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
